// tactical_squad_5v5's TankAttack — single-target damage with `range: 0`
// metadata (Strike has no spatial filter in tactical_squad_5v5.sim; the
// verb is a flat per-pair scoring kernel, not a spatial walk).
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: true },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 0.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Damage { amount: 10.0 }] }.
//
// CONFIG → REGISTRY BRIDGE: amount mirrors `config.combat.tank_damage =
// 10.0` in the .sim. apply_ability's pack-time literal API doesn't
// accept config refs today, so the runtime hardcodes the matching value;
// if the .sim config drifts, the binding-check assertion flags the
// divergence.

ability TankAttack {
    target: enemy
    range: 0
    cooldown: 0

    damage 10
}
